{"sourceUrl":"https://cicst.ustb.edu.cn/tzgg1/3dd38ca3ef8b435d99797ce26dfc8ee0.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:31.459316+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://cicst.ustb.edu.cn/tzgg1/3dd38ca3ef8b435d99797ce26dfc8ee0.htm","html":"<div>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、中心简介</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>钢铁共性技术协同创新中心（以下简称中心）是以北京科技大学和东北大学两所冶金特色高校为核心，联合宝武钢、鞍钢、首钢等国内龙头企业，钢研集团、中科院金属所等研究院所，上海大学、武汉科技大学等高校共同组建。中心于</span></span><span>2014</span><span><span>年入选国家</span><span>“</span></span><span>2011</span><span><span>计划</span><span>”</span><span>，成为钢铁领域唯一国家级</span><span>“</span></span><span>2011</span><span><span>协同创新中心</span><span>”</span><span>。</span></span><span>2022</span><span><span>年</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>月，国家启动了协同创新中心新一轮建设方案。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>钢铁共性技术协同创新中心本着</span><span>“</span><span>为我所用，德才兼备，协调互补，按需引进</span><span>”</span><span>的原则，有计划、多层次、多渠道地引进和培养国内外各类相关专业的科研和管理人才；注重复合型人才的吸纳和培养，提升人才能力，拓展专业分布。中心目前已组建高品质特殊钢、先进金属材料、海洋用钢、材料设计与优化、材料检测与智能制造</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>个研究所。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>中心主要研究方向与任务为：围绕钢铁行业</span><span>“</span><span>绿色化、智能化</span><span>”</span><span>战略转型的重大需求，研究钢铁智能制造与大数据应用、冶金多污染物协同控制及节能安全、洁净钢生产工艺与冶金渣系设计优化等关键技术，为钢铁工业实现智能制造和绿色制造提供前沿探索和重要支撑；围绕国家重大工程急需材料的自主研发，研究高性能钢铁材料在材料设计、制备工艺、服役性能等方面的前沿技术，满足国家在海洋平台、近海设施、跨海大桥、特种船舶等对高性能钢铁材料提出的高强、高韧、耐候、良好的低温性能以及优良的焊接性能的要求，开发现代交通设施、关键运输装备、核电与火电重大装备制造、深部油气开采、大型油气管线建设等亟需的高性能钢铁材料，研究特殊服役条件下材料组织性能退化与服役安全。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、申请条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，拥护社会主义制度，竭诚为社会主义现代化建设服务；道德品质良好，遵纪守法，身体健康。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span> <span><span>有望获得</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年推荐免试资格，硕士推免生入学前应取得国家承认的本科学历证书，直博生入学前应取得国家承认的本科学历证书和学士学位证书，否则录取资格无效。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.</span><span><span>英语水平良好。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4.</span><span><span>对拟申报的专业具有浓厚兴趣，具备攻读硕士研究生的基本能力和素质。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>5.</span><span><span>申请本科直博者，除满足以上条件外，应热爱科学研究，具有较强的科研创新能力和博士生培养潜力。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、接收推免生的类型与专业</span></span></strong></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>专业代码</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>专业名称</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>是否接受推免生</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>是否接受直博生</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>080200</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>机械工程</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>√</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>√</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>080400</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>仪器科学与技术</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>×</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>√</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>080500</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>材料科学与工程</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>√</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>√</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>080600</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>冶金工程</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>√</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>√</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>081200</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>计算机科学与技术</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>√</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>√</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>085404</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>计算机技术</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>√</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>×</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>085501</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>机械工程</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>√</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>×</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>085601</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>材料工程</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>√</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>×</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>085603</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>冶金工程</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>√</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>×</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>0871Z1</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>物流工程</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>×</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>√</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p><span><span>注：根据学校最新政策，学硕与专硕均可申请硕博连读。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、申请流程</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span><span>报名时间：</span></span><span><span>即日起至</span></span><span>9</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>13</span><span><span>日</span></span><span>23</span><span><span>：</span></span><span>59</span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span><span>报名方式：凡有意向申请者，包括本校生源在内，均须通过我校研究生招生管理信息系统申请报名。申请者可点击以下链接进入报名系统：</span></span><span>http://yjsy.ustb.edu.cn/ksxt</span><span><span>，招生项目选择</span><span>“</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年推免生预报名</span><span>”</span><span>（建议使用谷歌浏览器）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.</span><span><span>材料准备</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span><span>）身份证（正反面）及学生证；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span><span>）所在学校教务部门或学院盖章的前</span></span><span>3</span><span><span>年成绩单和成绩排名证明材料；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3</span><span><span>）体现英语水平的证明材料</span></span><span>(</span><span><span>大学英语四、六级成绩，</span></span><span>TOEFL</span><span><span>成绩，</span></span><span>GRE/GMAT</span><span><span>成绩等</span></span><span>)</span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4</span><span><span>）其他证明材料，如已发表论文、各类获奖或资格证书等；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>5</span><span><span>）对申请有参考价值的个人陈述（限</span></span><span>1000</span><span><span>字以内）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>6</span><span><span>）申请本科直博者还须提供《北京科技大学招收优秀应届本科毕业生直接攻读博士学位研究生专家推荐书》</span></span><span>2</span><span><span>份（须</span></span><span>2</span><span><span>名教授或相当职称的专家进行推荐，推荐人本人须签名）。此项材料在系统报名时可暂不上传，待取得推免资格并正式录取后提交中心。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>按照系统提示填写个人信息并上传相关证明材料的照片。材料提交截止日期为</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span>9</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>13</span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>23:59</span></span><span><span>，过期不再接受申请。</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五、材料审核</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>中心将在</span></span><span>9</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>13</span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>报名截止后</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>设立申请材料初审工作组，负责对考生申报材料开展评议审核，确定考生综合考核（复试）入围资格，申请人可登录推免系统查看审核结果，材料不符合要求者将被退回修改，请于规定时间重新上传，逾期视为自愿放弃。</span></span><span><span>请各位申请者关注我中心官网发布的相关通知</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>审核通过即获得预复试资格，申请者应在规定时间内及时在系统里缴纳</span></span><span>100</span><span><span>元复试费并确认参加复试，未在规定时间内缴费并确认参加复试的，视为自愿放弃。</span></span><span><span>缴纳预推免复试费后，如因个人原因未按时参加预复试的，已缴复试费不予退还。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>六、复试安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>我中心复试拟于</span></span><span>9</span><span><span>月中旬进行，具体安排将另行通知。请各位申请者关注我中心官网（</span></span><span>https://cicst.ustb.edu.cn/index.htm</span><span><span>）或短信通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>七、其他注意事项</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>通过我中心预推免面试考核的考生，务必按照教育部要求在规定时间内（</span></span><span>9</span><span><span>月下旬）登录中国研招网</span><span>“</span><span>推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>（网址：</span></span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span><span><span>）填报志愿，网上完成接收并确认我院的复试及待录取通知等环节。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>八、联系方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>联系地址</span></span><span>: </span><span><span>北京市海淀区学院路</span></span><span>30</span><span><span>号钢铁共性技术协同创新中心（科技楼</span></span><span>804</span><span><span>）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：周老师</span>  </span><span>010-62332052</span></p>\n<p><span><span>电子邮箱：</span></span><a href=\"mailto:cicst@ustb.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>cicst@ustb.edu.cn</span></a></p>\n<p><span><span>中心网站：</span></span><span>https://cicst.ustb.edu.cn/index.htm</span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>九、监督投诉</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：何老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系方式：</span></span><span>hefei@ustb.edu.cn</span></p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"4b062ec0e306164b3044c8c425cad67a9f75c2958f03d4add1e010009c487c1b","textLength":2145,"sourceSha256":"2737856e1fd5e65abbdf3ca27692d809f39a30013c35b27b61789b2535afcc2f","selector":"article-like:gp-article1 gp-article gp-f16","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-fcc4ddaed3049e2a59b2","title":"2026年北京科技大学钢铁共性技术协同创新中心2027年接收推荐免试硕士研究生（含直博生）预报名的通知（第二轮）","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:31.459316+00:00"}
